<title>GREECE: ERGOBANK OFFERS PERSONAL LOANS FOR OTE SHARES.</title>
<headline>ERGOBANK OFFERS PERSONAL LOANS FOR OTE SHARES.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>ErgoBank said on Tuesday that personal loans up to 1.0 million drachmas at a rate of 16.0 percent will be available to clients who wish to subscribe for shares of OTE telecom.</p>
<p>Allotments of OTE's shares will be held as collateral against the loan.</p>
<p>Subscriptions for OTE's public offering will take place during June 11-13.</p>
<p>An indicative price range for the shares shall be announced</p>
<p>late on June 10.</p>
<p>--George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
